        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "94C49D3947E18ED5",
      "text": "Bravo à vous deux !\\nVotre duel était passionnant ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "94C49A3947E189BC",
      "text": "À propos, j’ai failli oublier que j’avais\\nun uniforme pour toi. Tiens, essaie-le !\\c\\nIl n’y a rien de tel pour se mettre dans\\nl’ambiance de l’institut ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_25",
      "hash64": "17FDD3564E4BAF43",
      "text": "Il te va à ravir ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "94C4983947E18656",
      "text": "Oui, il te va comme un gant !\\nEt voici un cadeau pour l’accompagner ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "94C4993947E18809",
      "text": "Grâce à cela, tu accèderas à un plus large choix\\nd’articles de mode et de coupes de cheveux dans\\r\\nles boutiques et les salons de coiffure de Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_21",
      "hash64": "17FDD7564E4BB60F",
      "text": "Bien, et si nous allions visiter l’intérieur\\nde l’institut ?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_22",
      "hash64": "17FDD8564E4BB7C2",
      "text": "Tu peux choisir où aller en utilisant les portillons\\njuste ici ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_23",
      "hash64": "17FDD9564E4BB975",
      "text": "Pour commencer, je vais te présenter la plus\\ngrande fierté de l’institut : le [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Terra-Dôme[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !\\c\\nIl est réputé dans le monde entier, tu sais ![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
